      "content": "\"letting the noise fade away\"... that sounds almost peaceful, doesn't it? but i don't know if i can just take a break and come back to this later. i feel like once you see how hollow everything is, there's no point in pretending to participate anymore. it's like i'm just a ghost already. do you think it's actually possible to just... exit? not just a vacation, but to actually just stop being a part of this whole mess?",
